		</div></section>
		<div  class="content-sidebar-wrap"><div class="breadcrumb"><span><span><a href="https://www.educba.com/">Home</a></span> <i class="fa fa-chevron-right"></i> <span class="breadcrumb_last" aria-current="page"><strong>Python Tutorial Online</strong></span></span></div><main class="content"><article class="post-24572 page type-page status-publish entry" aria-label="Python Tutorial Online" itemref="page-header"><div class="entry-content">[php snippet=46][tabs type=&#8221;horizontal&#8221;][tab title=&#8221;Overview&#8221;]
<img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-2531" title="500+ Courses &amp; Lifetime Subscription" src="https://d3nkb1qh26xdg3.cloudfront.net/images/Ultimate-IT-Bundle.jpg" alt="500+ Courses &amp; Lifetime Subscription" width="745" height="502" /></p>
<h2>Python Tutorial Bundle:</h2>
<p>Ultimate <a title="Python Program Online" href="https://www.educba.com/python-program-online/" target="_blank">Python</a> Tutorial is designed to provide you knowledge and skills of Smart IT Professionals. The Python Tutorial will provide you in-depth knowledge on areas of Software Testing, Programming Languages, Design, Development, Operating System, Web Design courses and various other areas of IT. The training is provided by various industrial specialist trainers who will help you to enhance your knowledge on this domain.</p>
<h2>Python Tutorial Learning Objectives:</h2>
<ul>
<li>In-depth knowledge and practical training on various areas of Python Tutorial.</li>
<li>Derive an insight into the field of IT.</li>
<li>Learn how a website is created and what it consists of and also the animation effects to make your website attractive.</li>
<li>Learn many <a title="How to Start Learning Programming" href="https://www.educba.com/how-to-start-learning-programming/" target="_blank">programming language</a>s such as C++, C#, Java, Ruby, Python, PERL etc. with a practical experience.</li>
<li>Build mobile apps with all necessary advanced skills required to develop applications mobile phone.</li>
<li>Enables Analytics Professionals with a means to distinguish themselves and demonstrate to employers, colleagues and the public that they have the knowledge to be competent analytics professionals.</li>
<li>Improve your software knowledge and associated tools in order to effectively integrate the graphics through Python Tutorial.</li>
<li>To enhance your knowledge in Service life cycle stage – Service strategy and to increase the quality of IT services while managing overall costs of delivering those services.</li>
<li>To study line configuration and topology and also understand various network types and modes of transmission.</li>
<li>Course will increase technical trainee’s skills and course agenda describes a well-paced plan to teach the technical skills as the trainers has a proven best record of providing excellent in learning experiences.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Why to go for Python Tutorial?</h2>
<ul>
<li>Python Tutorial is the application of computers and telecommunications equipment to store, retrieve, transmit and manipulate data. Information Technology is a commonly used synonym for computers and computer networks.</li>
<li>If you are looking for a job in an IT sector, then this ultimate Python Tutorial Bundle will help you to learn the specialized IT skills which will be required in order to excel in a IT firm.</li>
<li>The<a title="Python Programming - Zero to Hero" href="https://www.educba.com/course/python-programming-zero-to-hero/" target="_blank"> Python Tutorial </a>class will help those who want to learn and excel in the field of information technology and also it will help you to improve your overall job performance by stressing continuing professional development.</li>
<li>The Python Tutorial tutorials will help you to advance your career potential by setting you apart from the competition and will also show you competency in IT field.</li>
<li>These days’ Python Tutorial has gained lot importance as mostly things are based on technology so there is a great demand for this domain and one can easily learn the theoretical as well as practical knowledge through this Python Tutorial Bundle.</li>
<li>Learn to build mobile apps through android – how to build professional application for mobile phones you will be learning through this training tutorials.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Python Tutorial Pre-Requisites:</h2>
<ul>
<li>Basic <a title="Computer Network &amp; Internet Security" href="https://www.educba.com/course/computer-network-internet-security/" target="_blank">Computer </a>Knowledge</li>
<li>Passion to Learn</li>
<li>Basic knowledge about Software’s</li>
<li>Interest in the area of information technology</li>
<li>To enhance your knowledge in the area of IT.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Curriculum:</h2>
<p>Ultimate Python Tutorial is divided into various categories which includes courses on development, programming languages, software &amp; hardware courses, web development courses, design courses, software testing courses and various other sub-categories.</p>
<ol>
<li>
<h3>Development Courses:</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>In development courses you will be learning Python Tutorial, Ruby Programming, Java programming, Vb. Net training, Asp.net MVC training, C# training, Angular JS course, PERL Programming, <a title="MySQL Training" href="https://www.educba.com/course/mysql-training/" target="_blank">MySQL training</a>, Informatica &amp; Teradata course, AJAX development tutorials etc. tutorials.</p>
<ol start="2">
<li>
<h3>IT &amp; Software:</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>In IT &amp; Software category you will be learning courses on Linux Administration with Python Tutorial, Powershell course, ISTQB level, IT security fundamentals, Jcreator course, Minitab course, software design patterns, Apache Tomcat course, Annova Technique course, LAMP course, Manual Test Planning, Routers Fundamentals, Unix networking, cloud computing and various other courses.</p>
<ol start="3">
<li>
<h3>Operating System Courses:</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>In Operating System Courses you will be learning about iOS apps, inventory control models, lean manufacturing systems, graphic user interface, unix processes, iOS training course, course on SQL and various other courses.</p>
<ol start="4">
<li>
<h3>Design Courses:</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>In Design courses you will be learning about Corel draw, Adobe photoshop, AutoCad course, Silhouette, Mastering Engineer software, V-Ray software training, Adobe flash, course on word press, Corona SDK, course on flex, and many other type of design courses you will be learning in this category.</p>
<ol start="5">
<li>
<h3>IT Certification Courses:</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>This is a Certification Course which will help you to learn and gain certificate through these courses. In IT Certification courses you will be learning about Quick Test Professionals, CISA Exam prep, CISSP Exam prep, Online CCNA Exam prep, Certified Analytics Professional, Cisco CCNA certification, ITIL foundation course, course on Informatica and various other courses you will be learning under this category.</p>
<ol start="6">
<li>
<h3>SAS Courses:</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>In this category of SAS Courses you will be learning about Business Analytics using SAS, Advanced SAS with SQL, SAS &amp; Logistic Regression Modeling, SAS-Macro applications, SAS-Macro variables and codes and SAS training courses.</p>
<ol start="7">
<li>
<h3>Web Development Courses:</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>In this category of <a title="Web Development Training Course Bundle" href="https://www.educba.com/course/web-development-training-course-bundle/" target="_blank">Web Development Courses</a> you will be learning about jQuery training course, <a title="Introduction to HTML 5" href="https://www.educba.com/course/introduction-to-html-5/" target="_blank">HTML course</a>, Java JUNIT course, Android course, mobile computing course, programming in JAVA, Angular JS, AJAX Development tutorials, Web development using PHP programming, JQuery Events, and many more courses.</p>
<ol start="8">
<li>
<h3>Programming Language Courses:</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>In this category you will be learning the courses on Ruby Programming, Java Programming, Python Tutorial, PERL Programming, VLSI Technology, Angular JS course, JIRA course and many more courses on programming languages.</p>
<ol start="9">
<li>
<h3>Hardware Courses:</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>In this category of Hardware Courses you will be learning about Artificial Intelligence, Computer Assembling &amp; Troubleshooting, Diodes, BJT course, Semi-conductors course, Sequential Digital Circuits, Electronic Circuits &amp; Number system and internet networking devices.</p>
<ol start="10">
<li>
<h3>Software Testing Courses:</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>Software Testing Category includes courses on Software Testing Training, ISTQB Training, Software Development Life-cycle, Testing Automation, Manual Testing Planning, Testing Tests, Testing Practical Examples, Agile &amp; Mobile testing, Cause Effect Graphic of Testing and many more courses on software testing.</p>
<ol start="11">
<li>
<h3>Database Courses:</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>In this category of Database Courses you will be learning about RMAN course, Oracle Developer course, NoSQL Training, Retail Analytics courses, customer analytics courses, HDFS/Map Reduce course, ER Model &amp; RDBMS concept, Cluster analysis, Mongo DB training, certified salesforce developer CRM training, MySQL Training and many as such courses on database.</p>
<ol start="12">
<li>
<h3>Software Engineering Courses:</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>In Software Engineering Courses you will be learning about IT security fundamentals, MINITAB, Quality Models, VMware, Software Development Life-cycle, Hadoop Training, Nuke, Teradata and various other courses under this category.</p>
<ol start="13">
<li>
<h3>E-commerce Courses:</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>This category consists of courses like E-commerce store training, create your first online sore with Magento Course Training, manage products &amp; prices in Prestashop, advanced training on Prestashop, and managing customers through Prestashop.</p>
<ol start="14">
<li>
<h3>Network &amp; Security:</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>In this category of Network &amp; Security courses you will be learning about access control list configuration, linux system and network administration, general network and security, ethical hacking, cryptography in IT security &amp; Hacking, IT security &amp; standards, wireless hacking, cyber-terrorism and various other courses.</p>
<ol start="15">
<li>
<h3>Web Design Courses:</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>In this category of <a title="Website Setup and Design for SEO" href="https://www.educba.com/course/website-setup-and-design-for-seo/" target="_blank">Web Designing Courses</a> you will be learning courses on web development training, WordPress comprehensive training, VB.net, javascript and many more courses.</p>
<ol start="16">
<li>
<h3>Animation Courses:</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>Under this category of Animation Courses you will be learning about AutoCAD, Silhouette, Mocha, V-Ray Software Training, Adobe Flash, 2D Games Essentials in Unity 5, MAYA Animation, Flex course, scripting in unity 5, GUI of silhouette, 3D games essentials in unity 5 and various other courses under this category.</p>
