<h2>Who Should go for this Python Tutorial?</h2>
<p>To stay ahead in this competitive world, having practical knowledge in IT has become a must-know. Although anybody can take up this bundle the following would be the appropriate audience to undertake it;</p>
<ul>
<li>Candidates pursuing their graduation in the field of IT, BSC-IT,</li>
<li>Candidates pursuing their post-graduation in the field of IT</li>
<li>Any working professionals who wants to enhance your knowledge in the area of IT</li>
<li>Anyone interested in learning about Programming Languages</li>
<li>Anyone interested in learning IT courses</li>
</ul>
<p class="back-to-top"><a href="#">Back to top ▴</a></p>
[/tab][tab title=&#8221;FAQs&#8221;]
<ol>
<li>
<h3>Are the online tutorials of Python Tutorial being as helpful as classroom training?</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>EduCBA is an online education provided where you will get the same feel of classroom training. The only difference is that the instructors are online trainers who will guide you thoroughly with all the concepts and if you happen to miss any lectures you can re-visit those lectures again and can learn the concept anytime anywhere unlike classroom training.</p>
<ol start="2">
<li>
<h3>Who are the instructors of Python Tutorial Bundle?</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>All our instructors or trainers are industrial expertise and are working professionals and have minimum 8 – 10 years of experience under various category of information technology. They are subject matter experts and they are being trained by eduCBA for how to conduct online training so that the learners get a great learning experience.</p>
<ol start="3">
<li>
<h3>Can I attend demo lectures of Python Tutorial?</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>Yes, of course by simply signing up for free you can get access for 10 free video tutorials which will helpful you to make decision about the video tutorials and you will get a clear insight that how the sessions are taken and also quality of instructors.</p>
<ol start="4">
<li>
<h3>What are the payment options?</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>You can pay from Credit Card, Debit Card or Net Banking from all the leading banks. For USD payment you can pay by Paypal.</p>
<ol start="5">
<li>
<h3>How long do I have access to these Python Tutorial?</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>You can take life time subscription or annual subscription to get the access for the tutorials lifetime or for a year.</p>
<ol start="6">
<li>
<h3>How soon after signing up would I get access to the learning course?</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>As soon as you enroll for the course, you will immediately get access to our course content and also you will get access to our 24&#215;7 support team assistance, you can start learning right away.</p>
<ol start="7">
<li>
<h3>Will I get assistance or support if I encountered any problem?</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>24&#215;7 access to video tutorials and email support from our technical team to help you and guide you if you face any trouble.</p>
<ol start="8">
<li>
<h3>Is there any offer or discounts which I can avail?</h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p>Yes, we do come up with multiple offers and discounts, please visit our website to avail those services.</p>
<p class="back-to-top"><a href="#">Back to top ▴</a></p>
[/tab][tab title=&#8221;Reviews&#8221;]
<p><strong><em>Shourya Rao, Andhra Pradesh</em></strong></p>
<blockquote><p>Thank you eduCBA for offering an amazing Python Tutorial Bundle, this bundle will provide you guidance about programming languages from scratch to advanced level. This bundle can be taken by the beginners as well to learn from the start. This online video tutorial will help you to learn anytime anywhere without any hassles. Seriously it’s a must take course for the one who is interested in learning about the programming languages.</p></blockquote>
<p><em><strong>Zohra Siddiqui, Faridabad</strong></em></p>
<blockquote><p>One of the finest online video tutorials I have find it out till date. The course quality simply amazing and quite exhaustible which will help you to learn about the concept thoroughly. I am very pleased with the Python Tutorial Bundle which provides you in detail knowledge about the information technology courses which will be very helpful for you to excel in the field of information technology. Thank you eduCBA for coming up with this course.</p></blockquote>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong><em>Kishor Mehta, Ahmedabad</em></strong></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<blockquote><p>It’s a great platform to learn courses on information technology, as I am a working professional and didn’t has much time to attend classes or tutorials to learn programming languages but through eduCBA bundle of Python Tutorial has helped me to gain knowledge and expertise in the area of programming languages. This online training tutorial has saved my lot of time and has also helped me to learn anywhere at any point of time. The course covers the in-depth knowledge about the subject. Good Job by eduCBA, thanks for providing this platform.</p></blockquote>
<p><em><strong>Vandana Bajaj, Dehradun</strong></em></p>
<blockquote><p> EduCBA has been one of my favorite online learning platform. It has provided me an intense knowledge in the area of information technology. Truly the quality of the course is superb as it not only covers the theoretical aspects but also the practical aspects. The Python Tutorial Bundle will help you to learn about the programming languages in detail. The instructor has made sure to provide you proper guidance about information technology. Thank you eduCBA for coming up with such courses.</p></blockquote>
